   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## HunyuanImage 3.0 Base · text to image\n\n**Model files** — from [HuggingFace](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Base-ComfyUI), into these folders (one of the three model formats: W4A8 is the smallest and fastest):\n\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| [hunyuan_image_3_base_w4a8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Base-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_base_w4a8.safetensors)<br>or [hunyuan_image_3_base_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Base-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_base_int8_convrot.safetensors)<br>or [hunyuan_image_3_base_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Base-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_base_bf16.safetensors) | `models/diffusion_models` |\n| [hunyuan_image_3_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Base-ComfyUI/blob/main/vae/hunyuan_image_3_vae_fp16.safetensors) | `models/vae` |\n\n**Settings:** **50 steps, cfg 5.0**, euler / simple. About 5 min for a 1024×1024 image on an RTX 4090, or about 1.5 min with Spectrum on.\n\n**How to use:** write your prompt in **Text Encode** and pick a size on **Resolutions**.\n\nNeeds a 24 GB GPU and about 50 GB of free system RAM; the model streams from RAM as it runs.\n\n---\n\nCustom Nodes and Workflow developed by **Pedro Marinho** · [x.com/PedroMarinhoDev](https://x.com/PedroMarinhoDev)\n\n[github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-HunyuanImage3](https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-HunyuanImage3)"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## HunyuanImage 3.0 Base · text to image\n\n**Model files** — from [HuggingFace](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Base-ComfyUI), into these folders (one of the three model formats: W4A8 is the smallest and fastest):\n\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| [hunyuan_image_3_base_w4a8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Base-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_base_w4a8.safetensors)<br>or [hunyuan_image_3_base_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Base-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_base_int8_convrot.safetensors)<br>or [hunyuan_image_3_base_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Base-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_base_bf16.safetensors) | `models/diffusion_models` |\n| [hunyuan_image_3_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Base-ComfyUI/blob/main/vae/hunyuan_image_3_vae_fp16.safetensors) | `models/vae` |\n\n**Settings:** **50 steps, cfg 5.0**, euler / simple. About 5 min for a 1024×1024 image on an RTX 4090, or about 1.5 min with Spectrum on.\n\n**How to use:** write your prompt in **Text Encode** and pick a size on **Resolutions**.\n\nNeeds a 24 GB GPU and about 50 GB of free system RAM; the model streams from RAM as it runs.\n\n---\n\nCustom Nodes and Workflow developed by **Pedro Marinho** · [x.com/PedroMarinhoDev](https://x.com/PedroMarinhoDev)\n\n[github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-HunyuanImage3](https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-HunyuanImage3)"
